Package: lugh-hyprbars
Architecture: any
Depends: hyprland (= ${hyprland:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fonts-inter
Description: Lugh title bars for Hyprland windows without their own
 The hyprbars plugin from hyprland-plugins, built for the exact Hyprland
 version in the archive and patched for Lugh: it draws a compact title bar
 (minimize, maximize, close on the right) only on windows that rely on the
 compositor for their frame (foot, kitty, mpv, Qt apps, X11 apps), and
 lets windows that asked for client-side decorations draw their own.
 .
 Loaded and styled by the Lugh session
 (/usr/share/lugh/hypr/lugh/titlebars.lua). Hyprland plugins must match the
 compositor build exactly, so this package depends on one Hyprland version
 and is rebuilt with every Hyprland update.
